### Plan to Implement the Problem
The implementation will follow the outlined plan while ensuring that security measures are integrated throughout the development process. Input validation will be applied to the `tags` parameter to sanitize user input, and HTML escaping will be used when rendering product data. Sensitive information will be handled securely, and production settings will be configured to enhance security. The application will be structured to meet both functional and security requirements effectively.

